# AskRepo frontend — copy to `.env.local` and adjust.

# Base URL of the AskRepo API.
# Read on the SERVER only — by the proxy route handler, the middleware, and
# serverFetch. The browser never calls the API directly, so this does NOT need to be
# reachable from the browser: under Docker Compose it is the service name
# (http://backend:8000), not the published host port.
API_URL=http://localhost:8000
